      "key": [
        "Crossroads Keep",
        "/\\bCrossroads\\b/",
        "Iron Road",
        "Crossroads mines",
        "Crossroads drawbridge",
        "Crossroads iron",
        "Lady of Crossroads"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Crossroads Keep",
      "content": "Crossroads Keep is cut into granite at the southern edge of the North. Narrow mountain roads lead to a single fifty-yard drawbridge hundreds of feet above the gorge. The keep commands the Iron Road into the Midlands. Its mines produce more iron than any others in the Known World. Loaded ore wagons cross one at a time. In fair weather the ride from Elerian Keep takes five days.",
